<header
  style="
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
    padding: var(--space-7) 0;
    background: var(--gold-100);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  "
>
  <h1 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2)">About HOSA</h1>
  <p
    style="
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    "
  >
    The Highway Old Students' Association connects generations of alumni from
    Highway Secondary School, Kiganda.
  </p>
</header>

<section class="stack-lg" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto">
  <div>
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>
      To foster lifelong connections among former students of Highway Secondary
      School, support the professional and personal growth of our members, and
      give back to the school that shaped us. We believe in the power of the
      HOSA network to uplift our community in Kassanda District and beyond.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h2>Our History</h2>
    <p>
      Highway Secondary School opened its doors in 2001. Since our first cohort
      graduated, our alumni have spread across Uganda and the world — serving as
      doctors, engineers, teachers, entrepreneurs, and leaders. HOSA was founded
      to keep that community alive, no matter where life takes us.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h2>What We Do</h2>
    <div
      style="
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
        gap: var(--space-4);
      "
    >
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2)">Connect</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: var(--text-sm)">
          Through our directory, alumni can find old friends, colleagues, and
          mentors in every industry.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2)">Mentor</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: var(--text-sm)">
          Our mentorship programme pairs experienced alumni with current
          students and recent graduates.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2)">Give Back</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: var(--text-sm)">
          We support the school through fundraising, facility improvements, and
          scholarship programs.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h2>Executive Committee</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--muted)">
      <em
        >Committee details will be published soon. Contact us to get
        involved.</em
      >
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
